cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TCP Trace Generator"
abstract: >-
  TCP Trace Generator is a Python/Scapy teaching tool that simulates a TCP
  connection with Reno or Tahoe congestion control and writes both a pcap
  capture of the exchanged segments and a CSV log of the sender's internal
  state (cwnd, ssthresh, RTO). Its discrete-time classroom mode produces
  clean, predictable traces that students can analyse by hand in computer
  networks courses.
